    "detailed_description": "A multiplayer game with one Boss player and multiple tiny players.<br><br>Boss players dodge the attacks of  players and attack using their throwing items, grenade launcher, hammers, etc., and tiny players perform cooperative play to attack huge Boss players.<br><br>tiny players' means of attack consist of regular bombs and explosive bombs, and chemical bombs that temporarily blind the opponent. An electronic bomb that temporarily limits an opponent's movement, a painkiller bomb that removes all restrictions and restores energy.<br><br><br>The basic  map terrain of the game is in the form of a cube, and in the future, we plan to allow users to create and distribute custom maps and to play the game in more diverse backgrounds.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Languague:</h2>English<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Feature:</h2> <ul class=\"bb_ul\">[*Multiplayer action game for cooperation and resolution between Boss and tiny  users (1 vs7).<li>Adopt simple game execution and play methods.<br></li><li>A game that all family members can play.</li></ul>",
